        "instruction": "You are going to read a magazine article in which four teenagers talk about their experiences of taking part in a reality TV series, which aims to find the best young business person. For questions 43–52, choose from the people (A–D). The people may be chosen more than once. Mark your answers on the separate answer sheet.",
